Modifications made for PhoneBuddy SDK:
- Dependency decoupling and trimming for iOS/Android mobile sandbox compatibility
- Replaced system process execution (`std::process` / `tokio::process`) with pure-Rust BusyBox applets & embedded JavaScript engine (Boa)
- In-memory Tokio task manager for subagent execution
- Switched to rustls with ring backend for TLS
- Added C FFI layer (`phone_buddy.h`) for mobile cross-platform integration
- Created Swift and Kotlin native wrapper SDKs

